  "description": "Hwang Geum-Woo, the CEO of the alcoholic beverage company “Golden Cloud,” has never dreamed once in his life. However, one fateful night, Geum-Woo finally experiences a dream. In the midst of his intriguing exploration, he encounters Eun Ho-Sung, the “Nightmare Guard,” who captures nightmares. Through his mysterious encounter with Ho-Sung, Geum-Woo’s mundane daily life begins to change little by little…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
